00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.760
needed for unpredictable weather.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:20.400
The combined funding includes dedicated technical support from Google researchers to deploy real-time

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.400
climate, agricultural, and language AI tools.

